WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.120
Israel is at war.
And I'm asking all ministries,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:10.840
all reborn Christians, to please pray with us.
We here stand with Israel.&nbsp;

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:17.000
And the evil that is working behind&nbsp;
the scenes, stands no chance.&nbsp;

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.720
Because God has already overcome this world.
So we are not afraid.&nbsp;

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:26.880
But it is our responsibility&nbsp;
to pray without ceasing.&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:32.800
And these things just show us that we&nbsp;
are getting closer to the end times.&nbsp;

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.480
Let's pray for Israel.
There's a lot of innocent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:46.360
people who are getting hurt, who are dying.
The devil is at work, but God is Lord of Lords.&nbsp;

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:52.520
He is King of Kings, and we should not fear.
He has not given us a spirit of fear, but of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:57.320
power, of love, and self-control.
So let's pray.

